# Shell scripts, the Makefile and psql scripts run under bash / make / psql even on a Windows
# checkout, and a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true, Git for Windows' default) breaks them: bash
# reads `set -euo pipefail\r` as an invalid option. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh      text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf
*.sql     text eol=lf
